---

## Remediation Recommendation

Recommended corrective action:

```text
Remove the unnecessary SMB share.
```

For a required production share, an alternative remediation would be:

```text
Restrict share access to explicitly authorized users or security groups.
```

---

## Remediation

The share was removed using:

```powershell
Remove-SmbShare -Name VULN31TEST -Force
```

---

## Local Verification

Local verification was performed using:

```powershell
Get-SmbShare -Name VULN31TEST
```

The share no longer existed.

---

## Remote Retest

WIN11-01 was used to repeat the original access test.

```cmd
dir \\WIN11-02\VULN31TEST
```

Result:

```text
Remote access failed.
```

The remote read test was also repeated:

```cmd
type \\WIN11-02\VULN31TEST\test.txt
```

Result:

```text
Access failed because the SMB share was no longer available.
```

---

## Cleanup

The local test directory was removed:

```powershell
Remove-Item C:\VULN31TEST -Recurse -Force
```

Cleanup was verified using:

```powershell
Test-Path C:\VULN31TEST
```

Expected:

```text
False
```

